/p><p>Oblique coronal T2-weighted MR image shows no definite evidence of hippocampal abnormality.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjr-2-63-g003"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Surgical Outcome versus Hippocampal Atrophy</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjr-2-63-i001"/></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Surgical Outcome versus T2 High Signal of the Hippocampus</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjr-2-63-i002"/></table-wrap></floats-group></article>